@startuml container-view
!include _theme.iuml
left to right direction

actor "Operator" as Operator
actor "CI/CD workflow" as Automation
component "TypeScript application" as Consumer

package "Trusted workstation or CI runner" {
  component "Octoform Node.js process\nCLI adapter and ESM library" as Process
  component "Octokit client\nREST transport" as Octokit
  file "Root YAML and imports\nDeclared desired state" as Config
  file "Local seed files\nCreate-if-missing content" as Seeds
  rectangle "Process environment\nGITHUB_TOKEN or GH_TOKEN" as Token
  rectangle "Standard output and error\nHuman-readable report" as Console
}

package "GitHub.com boundary" {
  component "REST API" as REST
  database "Owner and repository state" as State
}

Operator --> Process : command, filters and confirmation
Automation --> Process : command and protected inputs
Consumer --> Process : ESM imports and function calls
Config --> Process : configuration composition
Seeds --> Process : declared file content
Token --> Octokit : bearer credential in memory
Process --> Octokit : observation and mutation requests
Octokit --> REST : authenticated HTTPS
REST --> State : read or authorized mutation
State --> REST : current values
REST --> Octokit : response, headers or error
Octokit --> Process : state and capability evidence
Process --> Console : findings, plans and outcomes
Console --> Operator
Console --> Automation
@enduml
